      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Nooben2550 said:\n\n\"if you go to scene and add any object at all during the publish menu then it will update the last updated date correctly, i realized that last time the update date was correct was when i added some object to mah world during the publish screen, went to scene and add a plane with a picture to change the world thumbnail, so i now decided to try it out again and it worked, i just added a cube and hit publish, it updated the update date correctly, it could just be a coincidence tho\"",
      "viewerReactions": null,
