  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-02-15T17:05:32.518Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The VRChat API does not recognize the 'updated date' when a creator pushes out a new build for one of their worlds. This is seen on the VRChat client, and website.\n\nTo clarify: This does NOT affect the system_updated_recently tag, or the Updated Recently tab for the Worlds menu tab; only the \"Updated\" date on a world page.\n\nFor example, Jar updated her 'Murder 4' world to fit a recent holiday theme, it still shows that it was last updated in October. This bug also affects several other worlds.",
